# Igen Tech Landing Page Configuration Guide
#
# Environment variables are configured in the respective subdirectories.
# Please copy the .env.example files to .env in each directory:
#
# 1. Backend environment configuration:
#    File: backend/.env
#    Copy from backend/.env.example
#
# 2. Frontend environment configuration:
#    File: frontend/.env
#    Copy from frontend/.env.example
#
# Once configured, you can start the development server using:
#    yarn dev
